===Verb===
{{en-verb|postdat}}

# {{label|en|transitive}} To occur after an event or [[time]]; to exist later on in time
# {{label|en|transitive}} To assign an effective date to a [[document]] or action later than the actual date
#: ''to '''postdate''' a contract, that is, to date it later than the time when it was in fact made''
# {{label|en|transitive}} To affix a date to after the event. <!--i.e. put the true date on it, but later-->

